    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Level 3 — <strong>Escalation</strong></h2><p>Your Burn feeds itself.</p><h3>Mechanical Effects</h3><p>While you are at <strong>Burn 2–3 (Engaged)</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Your weapon attacks deal <strong>+tier damage</strong></p></li><li><p>Each hit that gains this bonus <strong>adds +1 Burn</strong> (once per turn)</p></li></ul><p>While you are at <strong>Burn 4+ (Overheated)</strong>:</p><ul><li><p>Your weapon attacks deal <strong>+tier additional damage</strong> (total +2×tier)</p></li><li><p>Each hit automatically forces a <strong>Body check</strong> or the target is <strong>shaken</strong> (roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on its next attack)</p></li></ul><p>⚠️ <strong>Risk</strong></p><ul><li><p>Each missed attack at Burn 4+ allows the GM to trigger <strong>backlash</strong></p></li></ul><p>Escalation is not optional.<br />If you hit harder, you burn hotter.</p>",
